        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo DJO-147CUSTOM, 8.5 x 33.75 Push and Pull Handle Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSet of 8.5\" Center to Center (CTC)  straight door pull with a 33.75\" Center to Center (CTC) push bar. Made from 1\" diameter solid aluminum round bar stock. Packaged with 1/4-20 screw mounting hardware. Fits doors 1-1/2\" to 2-1/4\" thick.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/8-x-33-store-door-push-and-pull-handle-set\"><b>8\" x 33\" Push Bar Set</b></a> - <a href=\"/products/9-x-33-store-door-push-and-pull-handle-set\"><b>9\" x 33\" Push Bar Set</b></a> - <a href=\"/products/10-x-33-store-door-push-and-pull-handle-set\"><b>10\" x 33\" Push Bar Set</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n<p class=\"text\">\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Don-Jo DJO-147CUSTOM Push and Pull Handle Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Center to Center (CTC): 8.5\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Total Length: 9.5\" </li>\r\n\r\n<li>Push Bar Diameter: 1\" (25 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Push Bar  Projection: 2-1/4\" (57 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Push Bar  Clearance: 1-1/4\" (32 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Push Bar  Center to Center (CTC): 33.75\" </li>\r\n<li>Push Bar Total Length: 34.75\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Aluminum</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/2\" to 2-1/4\" Thick Door</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with 1/4-20 Screws</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Clear Anodized Aluminum</b></li>\r\n<li>ADA Compliant</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>****CUSTOM ITEM, NOT RETURNABLE****</b>\r\n</p>",
